#ASSERT `s 171ZE(4) statutory paternity pay is payable to him in respect of the statutory pay week` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZE(4) statutory paternity pay is payable to him in respect of the statutory pay week` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZE(4) statutory paternity pay is payable to him in respect of the statutory pay week` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Arguments: the other works under a contract of service during part of the week; that contract existed immediately before the week (immaterial).
#ASSERT `s 171ZE(5) the person is liable to pay statutory paternity pay to the other in respect of the statutory pay week` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZE(5) the person is liable to pay statutory paternity pay to the other in respect of the statutory pay week` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZE(5) the person is liable to pay statutory paternity pay to the other in respect of the statutory pay week` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZE(5) the person is liable to pay statutory paternity pay to the other in respect of the statutory pay week` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Arguments: during part of the week he works for an employer not liable to pay him; the case is prescribed.
#ASSERT `s 171ZE(7) statutory paternity pay is payable to him in respect of the statutory pay week` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 171ZE(7) statutory paternity pay is payable to him in respect of the statutory pay week` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZE(7) statutory paternity pay is payable to him in respect of the statutory pay week` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZE(7) statutory paternity pay is payable to him in respect of the statutory pay week` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 171ZE(10A) to (13) -- daily rate, statutory pay week, other placements`

-- One seventh of the weekly rate: 140 a week is 20 a day; 175 is 25.
#ASSERT `s 171ZE(10A) the daily rate of statutory paternity pay in pounds` 140 EQUALS 20
#ASSERT `s 171ZE(10A) the daily rate of statutory paternity pay in pounds` 175 EQUALS 25
#ASSERT `s 171ZE(11) the week is a statutory pay week` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 171ZE(11) the week is a statutory pay week` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Arguments: payable by virtue of section 171ZB(8); payable by virtue of section 171ZB(10).
