#ASSERT `s 171ZE(12) the placement that the references to placement for adoption are read as` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST `placed under section 81 of the Social Services and Well-being (Wales) Act 2014`
#ASSERT `s 171ZE(12) the placement that the references to placement for adoption are read as` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 171ZE(12) the placement that the references to placement for adoption are read as` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 171ZF -- contracting out`

